      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/mspwestmi/status/2058584710897410523",
      "text": "Traffic Advisory / Semi Crash\n\nTroopers with the Michigan State Police are currently working a semi crash on southbound US-131 just past I-96.\n\nThe semi is partially blocking a lane and motorists should expect delays while crews work to clear the scene.\n\nThe driver of the semi is being transported to Corewell Health Butterworth Hospital with minor injuries.\n\nRain has made roadways extremely slippery and Troopers have responded to multiple single-vehicle crashes caused by drivers overdriving roadway conditions and hydroplaning.\n\nPlease slow down, increase following distance, and use extra caution during wet weather driving conditions.",
